  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported GetLoadCase, GetLoadCases, GetLoadCasesFromIds, GetLoadCasesOfType and GetEnvelopeIds with complete matching XML IntelliSense. Preserved family-wide metadata validation, absent lookup nulls, inclusive range filters and distinct existing-ID selection. Added eager independent list results and qualified bounded envelope IDs with strict integer success, written-array checks and count rechecking. Retained shared lifecycle/thread/reentrancy guards. See the load-case metadata guide for examples and qualification limits.",
